# Cornell Box (Original) with an interior partition wall at x=0.30,
# floor-to-ceiling, full Z-extent. Creates a right-side alcove (x > 0.30) that
# receives ZERO direct light from the ceiling fixture (light's xz extent is
# [-0.24, 0.23] x [-0.22, 0.16], all on the left side of the partition).
#
# Phase 2 bake-leak test scene: probes inside the alcove should show ~0
# direct radiance in the left-facing bins (those bins' rays hit the partition).
# Mode 0 (no visibility) leaks light through the partition into the alcove;
# Phase 2 interval-merge atlas should keep the alcove correctly dim.
#
# Derived from CornellBox-Original.obj (Guedis Cardenas + Morgan McGuire,
# Williams College, 2011, public domain). All original geometry preserved
# bit-identical; partition is appended as the final group "g partition".

mtllib CornellBox-Original-Alcove.mtl

## Object floor
v  -1.01  0.00   0.99
v   1.00  0.00   0.99
v   1.00  0.00  -1.04
v  -0.99  0.00  -1.04

g floor
usemtl floor
f -4 -3 -2 -1

## Object ceiling
v  -1.02  1.99   0.99
v  -1.02  1.99  -1.04
v   1.00  1.99  -1.04
v   1.00  1.99   0.99

g ceiling
usemtl ceiling
f -4 -3 -2 -1

## Object backwall
v  -0.99  0.00  -1.04
v   1.00  0.00  -1.04
v   1.00  1.99  -1.04
v  -1.02  1.99  -1.04

g backWall
usemtl backWall
f -4 -3 -2 -1

## Object rightwall
v   1.00  0.00  -1.04
v   1.00  0.00   0.99
v   1.00  1.99   0.99
v   1.00  1.99  -1.04

g rightWall
usemtl rightWall
f -4 -3 -2 -1

## Object leftWall
v  -1.01  0.00   0.99
v  -0.99  0.00  -1.04
v  -1.02  1.99  -1.04
v  -1.02  1.99   0.99

g leftWall
usemtl leftWall
f -4 -3 -2 -1

## Object shortBox
usemtl shortBox

# Top Face
v   0.53  0.60   0.75
v   0.70  0.60   0.17
v   0.13  0.60   0.00
v  -0.05  0.60   0.57
f -4 -3 -2 -1

# Left Face
v  -0.05  0.00   0.57
v  -0.05  0.60   0.57
v   0.13  0.60   0.00
v   0.13  0.00   0.00
f -4 -3 -2 -1

# Front Face
v   0.53  0.00   0.75
v   0.53  0.60   0.75
v  -0.05  0.60   0.57
v  -0.05  0.00   0.57
f -4 -3 -2 -1

# Right Face
v   0.70  0.00   0.17
v   0.70  0.60   0.17
v   0.53  0.60   0.75
v   0.53  0.00   0.75
f -4 -3 -2 -1

# Back Face
v   0.13  0.00   0.00
v   0.13  0.60   0.00
v   0.70  0.60   0.17
v   0.70  0.00   0.17
f -4 -3 -2 -1

g shortBox
usemtl shortBox

## Object tallBox
usemtl tallBox

# Top Face
v  -0.53  1.20   0.09
v   0.04  1.20  -0.09
v  -0.14  1.20  -0.67
v  -0.71  1.20  -0.49
f -4 -3 -2 -1

# Left Face
v  -0.53  0.00   0.09
v  -0.53  1.20   0.09
v  -0.71  1.20  -0.49
v  -0.71  0.00  -0.49
f -4 -3 -2 -1

# Back Face
v  -0.71  0.00  -0.49
v  -0.71  1.20  -0.49
v  -0.14  1.20  -0.67
v  -0.14  0.00  -0.67
f -4 -3 -2 -1

# Right Face
v  -0.14  0.00  -0.67
v  -0.14  1.20  -0.67
v   0.04  1.20  -0.09
v   0.04  0.00  -0.09
f -4 -3 -2 -1

# Front Face
v   0.04  0.00  -0.09
v   0.04  1.20  -0.09
v  -0.53  1.20   0.09
v  -0.53  0.00   0.09
f -4 -3 -2 -1

g tallBox
usemtl tallBox

## Object light
v  -0.24  1.98   0.16
v  -0.24  1.98  -0.22
v   0.23  1.98  -0.22
v   0.23  1.98   0.16

g light
usemtl light
f -4 -3 -2 -1

## Object partition (NEW — Phase 2 bake-leak test)
# Floor-to-ceiling vertical wall at x=0.30, full z-extent.
# Splits the box into a lit left side (x < 0.30, contains light fixture) and
# an unlit right alcove (x > 0.30, receives only multi-bounce indirect light).
v   0.30  0.00   0.99
v   0.30  0.00  -1.04
v   0.30  1.99  -1.04
v   0.30  1.99   0.99

g partition
usemtl partition
f -4 -3 -2 -1
